OL,3,ARosenberg: US diplomatic push offers
OL,4,Alittle hope for imminent Ukraine peace
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter two days of diplomacy ` in
OL,7,FNorway's capital and Russia's St
OL,8,FPetersburg ` is the war in Ukraine any
OL,9,Fcloser to ending?
OL,11,F"Good and constructive" is how Norway's
OL,12,Fprime minister described Tuesday's
OL,13,Ftalks between Ukrainian President
OL,14,FVolodymyr Zelensky, US President
OL,15,FTrump's special envoy Steve Witkoff and
OL,16,FEuropean representatives.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
